{"seq":51,"slug":"smalltalk-message-passing","title":"Smalltalk 与消息传递","stage":"DONE","category":"languages","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/smalltalk-message-passing","rating":{"composite":3.93,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":5,"strategic":3.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"smalltalk-与消息传递-总览\">Smalltalk 与消息传递·总览</h1><p>1972 年在 Xerox PARC，Alan Kay 和学习研究组想做的不是又一门语言，而是一台「能被孩子塑造的个人计算机」。Smalltalk 是这个愿景落地的副产品，却意外地把面向对象编程、图形界面、即时编译、活环境这几样东西一次性带到了世界面前。半个世纪后，它的语法早已不流行，但它的两个内核——「一切皆对象」与「计算即对象间互发消息」——仍在 Ruby、Objective-C、Erlang、乃至今天的 actor 模型里继续跳动。这个 hub 想讲清楚的，正是这两个内核为什么重要，以及一个把它们贯彻到底的系统会长成什么样。</p>\n<p>全 hub 沿一条「从哲学到实践」的递进线展开，分四章：</p>\n<p>第一章「基础」立三块基石：万物皆对象（连整数、true、类自己都是对象）、消息传递取代函数调用成为唯一的计算原语、以及把整个运行世界冻结进一个 image 文件的活环境。这三点决定了后面一切的形态，必须先读。</p>\n<p>第二章「语言核心」讲把基础理念变成可写代码的机制：类与元类构成的对象塔、作为一等公民的块闭包、以及那套被反复称道的统一集合协议。读完这章你能读写真实的 Smalltalk 代码。</p>\n<p>第三章「活系统」讲 Smalltalk 最独特的开发体验——程序不是被「构建」出来再运行，而是始终活着、可被检视和改写：运行时反射与元编程、在调试器里直接续写代码、以及 Morphic 那种可以伸手抓住界面元素的直接操作。</p>\n<p>第四章「影响与实践」把镜头拉回今天：Smalltalk 如何塑造了后世主流语言（MVC、Objective-C 的方括号、Ruby 的一切皆对象都源出于此）、Pharo 与 Glamorous Toolkit 代表的现代复兴、以及在 2026 年的真实工程里它适合与不适合做什么。</p>\n<p>与兄弟 hub 的边界：本 hub 只在「消息传递与活对象系统」这个独特视角下展开，不重复讲通用面向对象或函数式理论。块闭包的纯函数式深层理论交给 <a href=\"../functional-programming/\">函数式编程</a>；运行时改代码的通用机制交给 <a href=\"../metaprogramming/\">元编程</a>；Ruby 自身的语法生态交给 <a href=\"../ruby-language/\">Ruby 语言</a>；语言设计的一般权衡交给 <a href=\"../programming-language-design/\">编程语言设计</a>。这些 hub 里出现的概念，本 hub 只在它影响 Smalltalk 的那一面点到并链接过去。</p>\n<p>推荐学习路径：对面向对象有基础的工程师，可顺序通读四章；只想了解「消息传递到底特殊在哪」的读者，读第一章 1、2 两篇加第四章首篇即可；想动手的读者，先读第一章再直接跳到第四章的 Pharo 与实战两篇。前置知识：理解任意一门面向对象语言（Java/Python/Ruby 皆可）的类与方法概念，无需 Smalltalk 经验。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/smalltalk-message-passing/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"everything-is-object","title":"一切皆对象","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/smalltalk-message-passing/foundations/everything-is-object"},{"seq":2,"slug":"message-passing-model","title":"消息传递模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/smalltalk-message-passing/foundations/message-passing-model"},{"seq":3,"slug":"image-based-environment","title":"镜像式活环境","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/smalltalk-message-passing/foundations/image-based-environment"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"language-core","title":"语言核心","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/smalltalk-message-passing/language-core","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"classes-metaclasses","title":"类与元类","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/smalltalk-message-passing/language-core/classes-metaclasses"},{"seq":2,"slug":"blocks-closures","title":"块与闭包","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/smalltalk-message-passing/language-core/blocks-closures"},{"seq":3,"slug":"collections-protocol","title":"集合协议","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/smalltalk-message-passing/language-core/collections-protocol"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"live-system","title":"活系统","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/smalltalk-message-passing/live-system","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"reflection-metaprogramming","title":"反射与元编程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/smalltalk-message-passing/live-system/reflection-metaprogramming"},{"seq":2,"slug":"debugger-driven-development","title":"调试器驱动开发","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/smalltalk-message-passing/live-system/debugger-driven-development"},{"seq":3,"slug":"morphic-live-ui","title":"Morphic 活界面","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/smalltalk-message-passing/live-system/morphic-live-ui"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"influence-practice","title":"影响与实践","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/smalltalk-message-passing/influence-practice","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"influence-on-languages","title":"对后世语言的影响：一条从 PARC 流出的暗河","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/smalltalk-message-passing/influence-practice/influence-on-languages"},{"seq":2,"slug":"pharo-modern-smalltalk","title":"Pharo 与现代 Smalltalk：没死，只是换了旗舰","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/smalltalk-message-passing/influence-practice/pharo-modern-smalltalk"},{"seq":3,"slug":"smalltalk-in-practice","title":"实战与适用场景：把世界观折算成一个工程决策","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/smalltalk-message-passing/influence-practice/smalltalk-in-practice"}]}]}